#: colorscm.cpp:327
msgid "Import Color Scheme"
msgstr "Importi koloraron"

#: colorscm.cpp:340
msgid ""
"The scheme you have selected appears to be a KDE3 scheme.\n"
"\n"
"KDE will attempt to import this scheme, however many color roles have been "
"added since KDE3. Some manual work will likely be required.\n"
"\n"
"This scheme will not be saved automatically."
msgstr ""
"La elektita etoso ŝajnas esti KDE3-estoso.\n"
"\n"
"KDE importos tiun etoson, tamen pro novaj koloroj aldonitaj ekde KDE3, iom "
"da manlaboro eble estos bezonata.\n"
"\n"
"Tiu etoso ne estos aŭtomatike sendita."

#: colorscm.cpp:344
msgid "Notice"
msgstr "Rimarku"

#: colorscm.cpp:416
msgid "Please save the color scheme before uploading it."
msgstr ""

#: colorscm.cpp:417
msgid "Please save"
msgstr ""

#: colorscm.cpp:447 colorscm.cpp:478
msgid "Save Color Scheme"
msgstr "Konservi koloraron"

#: colorscm.cpp:448
msgid "&Enter a name for the color scheme:"
msgstr "&Doni nomon por tiu koloraro:"

#: colorscm.cpp:477
msgid ""
"A color scheme with that name already exists.\n"
"Do you want to overwrite it?"
msgstr ""
"Koloraro tiel nomita jam ekzistas.\n"
"Ĉu anstataŭigi ĝin?"

#: colorscm.cpp:535
msgid "You do not have permission to overwrite that scheme"
msgstr "Vi ne rajtas anstataŭigi tiun koloraron"

